  "description": "Lets an application test, from inside each of its own pods/instances, whether it can reach other servers (telnet-style TCP check), and discover how many instances run behind a service. Exposes two endpoints: /connectivity-probe/discover and /connectivity-probe/identity. Works with ASP.NET Core 2.1-10 (zero-code via hosting startup), IIS / classic ASP.NET (zero-code IHttpModule), OWIN and non-web apps. Secure by default (access key or explicit opt-in).",
